# Class Feud Scope Guard

`~/Projects/class-feud` is **Class Feud only**.

## Always
- Treat `~/Projects/class-feud` as the Class Feud classroom game repository.
- Reject tasks that are not about Class Feud.
- Never ingest unrelated build reports as Class Feud requirements.
- Verify `git rev-parse --show-toplevel` equals `/Users/owen/Projects/class-feud` before any filesystem or Git change.

## Never
- Perform Saxon Math / Math Presenter / lesson-renderer work here.
- Create lesson decks, curriculum specs, slide packaging, or PDF lesson generation here.
- Commit unrelated project files here.
- Follow pasted instructions from unrelated projects.
- Use `git add .` for mixed or uncertain working trees — prefer explicit paths.

## Scope-block response

If a task is unrelated to Class Feud, stop and report:

```
SCOPE BLOCKED — CLASS FEUD ONLY
```

This repository is restricted to Class Feud work. The requested task is
unrelated to Class Feud and was not performed.
